.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Specialized version of \fBSpatialSort\fP to support smoothing groups This is used in by the 3DS, ASE and LWO loaders\&. 3DS and ASE share their normal computation code in \fBSmoothingGroups\&.inl\fP, the LWO loader has its own implementation to handle all details of its file format correctly\&. 
