.SS "\fBvoid\fP Assimp::SGSpatialSort::FindPositions (const \fBaiVector3D\fP & pPosition, uint32_t pSG, float pRadius, std::vector< unsigned int > & poResults, bool exactMatch = \fRfalse\fP) const"
Returns an iterator for all positions close to the given position\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpPosition\fP The position to look for vertices\&. 
.br
\fIpSG\fP Only included vertices with at least one shared smooth group 
.br
\fIpRadius\fP Maximal distance from the position a vertex may have to be counted in\&. 
.br
\fIpoResults\fP The container to store the indices of the found positions\&. Will be emptied by the call so it may contain anything\&. 
.br
\fIexactMatch\fP Specifies whether smoothing groups are bit masks (false) or integral values (true)\&. In the latter case, a vertex cannot belong to more than one smoothing group\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
An iterator to iterate over all vertices in the given area\&. 
.RE
.PP

